From 5b292b578f559eb8bb5d9ec29aef5f2b650d363e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Captain Polliwog build <build@captainpolliwog.invalid>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 10:19:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 48/53] JSC: native LLInt for 32-bit PowerPC

An offlineasm PPC backend (Darwin ABI, cctools syntax) and ENABLE(C_LOOP),
split from !ENABLE(JIT) so the assembly LLInt runs with the JIT off.
Big-endian JSValue returns are swapped at the C/JS boundaries, and
getHostCallReturnValue is defined in the LLInt for PPC.
